  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 611.07 Project Classifications: Minimum Impact Projects",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 611.07 Project Classifications: Minimum Impact Projects. The following projects shall qualify as minimum impact projects:\n\n(a) Dune restoration projects that meet the requirements for restoration under Env-Wt 407.04; and\n\n(b) Structure construction or other landscape alteration of previously-developed in-fill lots located in the dune slack area on which there are no threatened or endangered species.\n\nSource. #12806, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt600.html"
}
